  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Food Crisis Response Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to contribute to the Government of Kiribati&apos;s short-term efforts to improve the availability and affordability of food on the outer islands of Kiribati and encourage the production of local agricultural produce. By funding theILF for about two years, the Project will enable the program to continue without drawing down the RERF. This will give the Government the opportunity to examine policy options for ILF sustainability through separate technical assistance support.</narrative>
  </description>
